19. PRESENT CONTINUOUS – EXERCÍCIOS
1. Descubra o erro
Todas as frases abaixo possuem um erro. Encontre o erro e reescreva corretamente.

a) She are studying English.

b) They is playing soccer.

c) I studying programming.

d) He is play a game.

e) We am watching TV.

f) My brother are sleeping.

2. Complete com AM, IS ou ARE
Complete as frases.

a) I ______ studying English.

b) She ______ reading a book.

c) They ______ playing soccer.

d) We ______ learning programming.

e) He ______ using the computer.

f) You ______ watching TV.

g) Pedro ______ writing an exercise.

h) My friends ______ playing a game.

3. Coloque o verbo no ING
Complete usando a forma correta do verbo.

a) I am __________ English. (study)

b) She is __________ a book. (read)

c) They are __________ soccer. (play)

d) He is __________ to school. (go)

e) We are __________ TV. (watch)

f) Pedro is __________. (run)

g) Maria is __________ a message. (write)

h) The students are __________ on their chairs. (sit)

