20. Simple Present ou Present Continuous?
Escolha a forma correta do verbo.

Exemplo:
I __________ English every day.
(study / am studying)

✔ I study English every day.

a) She __________ at a school every day.
(works / is working)

b) She __________ right now.
(works / is working)

c) They __________ soccer every Saturday.
(play / are playing)

d) They __________ soccer now.
(play / are playing)

e) He __________ a computer every day.
(uses / is using)

f) He __________ the computer at the moment.
(uses / is using)

g) We __________ programming this semester.
(study / are studying)

h) My brother usually __________ TV at night.
(watches / is watching)

i) Look! My brother __________ TV now.
(watches / is watching)

j) I usually __________ coffee in the morning.
(drink / am drinking)
